# Continuum

Read `README.md`, `docs/HANDOVER.md`, and `docs/MAINTAINER-GUIDE.md` before broad changes. Follow relevant CP/ADR documents and current code; historical validation is not current release proof.

- Keep this source repository separate from users' project data, media, credentials, and build outputs.
- Preserve local project data and user edits. Never pull remote project state into an open working project or force-push a snapshot.
- AI suggestions require provenance and human review before canonical knowledge changes.
- Test the touched boundary and report unverified OS/device behavior honestly.
